    "pre_committed_test": "Written before the fit ran: cos ~0.99 => codeword is irrelevant and 0.6117 is the concept; cos ~0.6 => 0.6117 is bank/codeword structure and E12's interpretation collapses.",
    "outcome": "COLLAPSE branch. 0.5539 < 0.6117: a pure codeword swap moves d_surface MORE than a pure concept swap.",
    "conclusion": "The 0.6117 cannot be read as 'the concept-general fraction of d_surface'. At --position codeword_last, d_surface is at least as much a function of which token carries the codeword as of what that codeword means.",
